# Game levels

This server is not OSRS. Do not convert heartbeat or grind XP to a level
with the OSRS table, `13_034_431`, or any other guessed curve.

Skill **level** comes from the game client `baseLevel`:

- `fleet-status` JSON `levels` (and the pretty `levels` column)
- `bun .cursor/skills/fleet-account-stats/scripts/dump-skills.ts` (observe only)
- Grind line that already printed `Atk 99` / `Fishing 99` / `Ranged 76`
- `sdk.getSkill('Attack')?.baseLevel` in observe `cli` / MCP

Heartbeat `xp` is for **rates** (xp/h). Heartbeat `levels` is the client
level. If a snapshot has no `levels` (old file), say so — do not invert XP.
`dump-skills.ts` in control mode is forbidden — last controller wins.

```text
❌ BAD  heartbeat Attack 1_075_292 → “73 attack” via OSRS table
✅ GOOD fleet-status levels.Attack 99 / grind “Atk 99”
```
